1
00:00:01,793 --> 00:00:05,171
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:13,096 --> 00:00:14,764
[laughs]

3
00:00:33,158 --> 00:00:35,827
-[goon] <i>Lily Cruz!</i>
-[gunfire]

4
00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:38,955
[Lily] <i>What now?! Huh?</i>

5
00:00:39,039 --> 00:00:41,124
<i>Go ahead and have fun watching!</i>

6
00:00:41,207 --> 00:00:44,711
<i>Because once I get out of here,</i>
<i>along with my mother,</i>

7
00:00:44,794 --> 00:00:47,172
<i>I'll show you the meaning of fear!</i>

8
00:00:47,255 --> 00:00:48,089
-[glass shatters]
-[screams]

9
00:00:48,173 --> 00:00:49,966
[Helena] <i>If you hadn't stopped me,</i>

10
00:00:50,049 --> 00:00:51,760
<i>Lily Cruz would've bitten the dust by now!</i>

11
00:00:51,843 --> 00:00:53,720
[Jepoy] <i>Where are Lily and Auntie Camia?</i>

12
00:00:53,803 --> 00:00:55,430
[Arnaldo] <i>I think I know where Lily is.</i>

13
00:00:56,389 --> 00:00:58,141
<i>All I know is they were brought here.</i>

14
00:00:58,224 --> 00:01:00,810
<i>We better look for them. They should</i>
<i>be around here somewhere.</i>

15
00:01:00,894 --> 00:01:03,438
[Damian] <i>Raul, are you sure you're ready</i>
<i>to go against the Ardientes?</i>

16
00:01:03,521 --> 00:01:06,024
-[Raul] <i>I'm willing to do it for my son.</i>
-[Julio] <i>What's this?</i>

17
00:01:06,107 --> 00:01:08,359
[Helena] <i>That's impossible.</i>
<i>Damian is dead.</i>

18
00:01:08,443 --> 00:01:10,779
<i>I saw Diego kill Damian myself.</i>

19
00:01:10,862 --> 00:01:12,655
[Emilia] <i>What the hell is</i>
<i>Jaguar doing there?</i>

20
00:01:12,739 --> 00:01:16,201
[Julio] <i>How many lives does that</i>
<i>damn Cruz family have?!</i>

21
00:01:16,284 --> 00:01:17,786
[Camia] <i>Raul, why are you doing this?</i>

22
00:01:17,869 --> 00:01:20,830
[Raul] <i>Camia, let me make up</i>
<i>for everything I've done.</i>

23
00:01:20,914 --> 00:01:23,291
[Emilia] <i>Where are you two?</i>

24
00:01:23,374 --> 00:01:25,376
[Helena] <i>Emilia.</i>
<i>Your right, behind the crates.</i>

25
00:01:25,460 --> 00:01:26,920
<i>Come on out of there!</i>

26
00:01:27,003 --> 00:01:29,506
<i>-One! Two! Three!</i>
-[gunshots]

27
00:01:29,589 --> 00:01:30,340
[Raul grunts]

28
00:01:30,423 --> 00:01:32,884
[Emilia] <i>Let go, Jaguar! You traitor!</i>

29
00:01:34,093 --> 00:01:35,595
-[Emilia grunting]
-[gunshot]

30
00:01:36,721 --> 00:01:40,517
[Emilia sobbing]

31
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:43,394
[tense music playing]

32
00:01:45,605 --> 00:01:49,609
[somber music playing]

33
00:01:54,864 --> 00:01:56,074
I'm sorry, baby girl.

34
00:01:56,908 --> 00:01:59,160
But your husband had it coming.

35
00:02:00,245 --> 00:02:02,539
He played a very dangerous game,

36
00:02:02,622 --> 00:02:04,165
and that's the price he had to pay.

37
00:02:07,293 --> 00:02:09,754
Don't worry. You'll always have me.

38
00:02:09,838 --> 00:02:13,508
[somber music continues]

39
00:02:14,342 --> 00:02:16,469
[squealing]

40
00:02:16,553 --> 00:02:18,555
[groaning] Emilia.

41
00:02:18,638 --> 00:02:21,474
[Emilia sobbing]

42
00:02:23,143 --> 00:02:25,979
[Emilia wailing] No!

43
00:02:26,771 --> 00:02:29,232
-[crying] Raul!
-[Raul shushes]

44
00:02:29,691 --> 00:02:31,526
[shushes]

45
00:02:32,068 --> 00:02:33,611
Emilia. Emilia.

46
00:02:34,028 --> 00:02:35,405
Forgive me.

47
00:02:35,738 --> 00:02:37,407
[struggling] Forgive me if I was…

48
00:02:38,741 --> 00:02:42,954
never a good husband to you.

49
00:02:43,037 --> 00:02:44,747
-Emilia…
-[sobbing]

50
00:02:45,915 --> 00:02:48,001
I'm sorry I hurt you so much.

51
00:02:48,585 --> 00:02:51,129
I did love you. I really did.

52
00:02:52,714 --> 00:02:55,425
But I guess we just weren't meant to be.

53
00:02:56,801 --> 00:02:57,969
[Raul breathes raggedly]

54
00:02:58,052 --> 00:03:00,054
[somber music playing]

55
00:03:00,346 --> 00:03:02,849
Raul. Raul. Please.

56
00:03:03,349 --> 00:03:05,935
Please, no, no. Don't. Don't.

57
00:03:06,728 --> 00:03:08,980
-[Emilia crying]
-[Raul shushes]

58
00:03:09,439 --> 00:03:12,358
Emilia. Emilia. Emilia.

59
00:03:12,442 --> 00:03:14,694
[somber music continues]

60
00:03:14,777 --> 00:03:18,281
I'm begging you… stop this.

61
00:03:18,698 --> 00:03:23,620
Please… leave this all behind
before it's too late.

62
00:03:24,329 --> 00:03:26,831
-Emilia…
-[crying]

63
00:03:27,999 --> 00:03:29,167
[breathes raggedly]

64
00:03:29,250 --> 00:03:31,294
[Emilia crying]

65
00:03:31,377 --> 00:03:33,671
-[Raul breathes raggedly]
-[crying]

66
00:03:33,755 --> 00:03:35,298
No. No.

67
00:03:35,965 --> 00:03:38,927
[Emilia crying] No. No. No.

68
00:03:39,594 --> 00:03:41,554
[Emilia] No. No!

69
00:03:41,638 --> 00:03:45,433
[somber music playing]

70
00:03:46,100 --> 00:03:48,603
[squealing]

71
00:03:48,978 --> 00:03:50,313
[screaming]

72
00:03:51,648 --> 00:03:53,733
[wailing] Raul.

73
00:03:55,276 --> 00:03:57,278
[wailing]

74
00:03:57,570 --> 00:03:59,572
[screaming]

75
00:04:06,704 --> 00:04:08,456
[sobbing]

76
00:04:11,251 --> 00:04:13,378
Raul! Raul.

77
00:04:14,045 --> 00:04:15,129
No, please.

78
00:04:15,797 --> 00:04:16,589
Raul.

79
00:04:16,673 --> 00:04:18,967
[somber music continues]

80
00:04:19,968 --> 00:04:21,511
<i>-Huh?</i>
<i>-Is there something about tonight?</i>

81
00:04:21,594 --> 00:04:24,389
<i>-What are you talking about?</i>
<i>-This is how we met.</i>

82
00:04:24,681 --> 00:04:25,640
<i>I want you back.</i>

83
00:04:25,723 --> 00:04:27,433
<i>I want things back the way they were.</i>

84
00:04:27,767 --> 00:04:30,019
<i>Emilia, I love you so much.</i>

85
00:04:30,353 --> 00:04:31,771
<i>I would worship you.</i>

86
00:04:31,854 --> 00:04:33,106
<i>You know, Emilia,</i>

87
00:04:33,189 --> 00:04:37,110
<i>when I told you</i>
<i>I would change, I meant it.</i>

88
00:04:37,527 --> 00:04:40,446
<i>Emilia, I'd love to marry you again.</i>

89
00:04:40,530 --> 00:04:45,451
<i>Yes! Yes! I'll marry you again.</i>
<i>Over and over.</i>

90
00:04:45,910 --> 00:04:47,245
Raul!

91
00:04:48,246 --> 00:04:50,456
[sobbing]

92
00:04:57,088 --> 00:04:59,465
[Emilia] <i>Jaguar saved my life.</i>

93
00:04:59,549 --> 00:05:01,718
<i>So why would he kill me right away?</i>

94
00:05:01,801 --> 00:05:03,428
<i>Jaguar's quite the sweet talker, no?</i>

95
00:05:04,387 --> 00:05:05,596
<i>Just like Raul?</i>

96
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:08,975
[Jaguar] <i>I want my love to be</i>
<i>the one to help set you free.</i>

97
00:05:09,058 --> 00:05:10,893
[Emilia] <i>Wow, Jaguar.</i>

98
00:05:10,977 --> 00:05:14,272
<i>What if I fall for you and</i>
<i>you aren't ready?</i>

99
00:05:14,355 --> 00:05:18,985
<i>I can't believe this.</i>
<i>Did that just really happen?</i>

100
00:05:19,068 --> 00:05:20,361
<i>Thank you, Jaguar!</i>

101
00:05:20,445 --> 00:05:23,197
<i>I can't believe this! I am finally free!</i>

102
00:05:23,281 --> 00:05:26,534
[Jaguar] <i>As long as I'm here,</i>
<i>no one can hurt you.</i>

103
00:05:26,617 --> 00:05:28,870
<i>You know, I've never felt</i>
<i>so loved in my life.</i>

104
00:05:28,953 --> 00:05:31,289
<i>You're the only one</i>
<i>who made me feel this way.</i>

105
00:05:31,372 --> 00:05:32,707
<i>Thank you.</i>

106
00:05:34,417 --> 00:05:36,836
[crying]

107
00:05:38,421 --> 00:05:39,505
<i>Do you love me?</i>

108
00:05:40,548 --> 00:05:41,340
<i>Mm-hm.</i>

109
00:05:41,424 --> 00:05:43,342
<i>I don't think I can feel it, Emilia.</i>

110
00:05:43,676 --> 00:05:44,677
<i>I love you.</i>

111
00:05:44,761 --> 00:05:48,765
[somber music playing]

112
00:05:58,274 --> 00:05:59,650
[Emilia] Raul!

113
00:06:00,610 --> 00:06:04,363
[Emilia crying]

114
00:06:07,575 --> 00:06:09,619
I'm sorry, Raul.

115
00:06:11,245 --> 00:06:14,957
I love you, but this won't end here!

116
00:06:15,792 --> 00:06:18,878
I'm going to kill Lily Cruz
and Camia Cruz!

117
00:06:18,961 --> 00:06:19,962
Emilia.

118
00:06:20,254 --> 00:06:22,507
Emilia, stop this before it's too late.

119
00:06:25,218 --> 00:06:27,095
-Emilia.
-No.

120
00:06:27,970 --> 00:06:29,931
[Raul groaning]

121
00:06:30,598 --> 00:06:34,727
I'll kill you both,
Lily Cruz and Camia Cruz!

122
00:06:34,894 --> 00:06:38,940
[ominous music playing]

123
00:06:41,734 --> 00:06:42,735
[breathing heavily]

124
00:06:56,415 --> 00:06:57,792
Have you found them?

125
00:06:58,334 --> 00:06:59,335
[goon 2] Not yet.

126
00:06:59,752 --> 00:07:01,087
Where could they be hiding?

127
00:07:07,135 --> 00:07:11,139
[action music playing]

128
00:07:17,854 --> 00:07:19,647
This way. Let's rest here.

129
00:07:20,523 --> 00:07:21,524
Damian.

130
00:07:22,024 --> 00:07:23,025
[Damian groans]

131
00:07:25,236 --> 00:07:27,238
Damian, Raul is the other Jaguar?

132
00:07:28,156 --> 00:07:30,783
Yeah, I gave Raul that mask
when I was in prison.

133
00:07:31,451 --> 00:07:34,328
He used it to get his revenge
on the Ardientes.

134
00:07:36,706 --> 00:07:38,624
Raul ruined my family.

135
00:07:39,750 --> 00:07:41,127
Why did he help me?

136
00:07:42,253 --> 00:07:44,589
To repent for all his sins against us?

137
00:07:46,382 --> 00:07:48,926
After everything he did to us…

138
00:07:50,052 --> 00:07:51,345
does he think it'd be that easy?

139
00:07:51,429 --> 00:07:54,682
[somber piano music playing]

140
00:07:55,892 --> 00:07:57,810
You don't owe him your forgiveness.

141
00:07:59,145 --> 00:08:02,023
But try to give a chance to the
people who want to change…

142
00:08:02,899 --> 00:08:05,735
so you can be free from all
the pain you're carrying.

143
00:08:12,867 --> 00:08:13,993
Let's stay here for now.

144
00:08:24,337 --> 00:08:27,715
[action music playing]

145
00:08:27,798 --> 00:08:28,966
-Sir.
-Yes?

146
00:08:29,342 --> 00:08:30,676
Lily Cruz got away.

147
00:08:33,262 --> 00:08:34,931
[goon 1] And we got attacked by Jaguar.

148
00:08:36,516 --> 00:08:37,642
Go on, clean that up.

149
00:08:38,726 --> 00:08:39,685
Move!

150
00:08:39,769 --> 00:08:42,980
[action music playing]

151
00:08:56,994 --> 00:08:58,788
[Lily] <i>You were the one</i>
<i>guarding my mother.</i>

152
00:08:59,163 --> 00:09:03,000
[tense music playing]

153
00:09:21,143 --> 00:09:23,187
[metal clanking]

154
00:09:27,149 --> 00:09:30,236
Arnaldo, I've searched the whole place,
but they aren't here.

155
00:09:30,319 --> 00:09:32,613
Do you think I'm stupid? Where are they?

156
00:09:33,739 --> 00:09:35,157
Hold on, I don't know.

157
00:09:35,241 --> 00:09:37,410
They might've escaped,
or maybe they were moved.

158
00:09:38,035 --> 00:09:39,870
-You bastard.
-I mean, it's possible.

159
00:09:39,954 --> 00:09:41,831
Are you playing games with me?!

160
00:09:42,873 --> 00:09:46,043
No, don't point your gun at me. I'm not--

161
00:09:46,877 --> 00:09:49,005
Do you think I'm stupid?
You're stalling or something!

162
00:09:50,673 --> 00:09:51,841
Where are they?!

163
00:09:55,303 --> 00:09:56,429
I don't know what you're talking about.

164
00:09:56,512 --> 00:09:58,180
I'm trying to help you, Jepoy.

165
00:09:58,264 --> 00:09:59,932
Your family kidnapped them.

166
00:10:00,558 --> 00:10:02,101
Why should I trust you?

167
00:10:02,184 --> 00:10:04,353
They might be my family,
but you're my friends.

168
00:10:05,521 --> 00:10:09,233
I won't let any one of you
get harmed, especially not Lily.

169
00:10:10,067 --> 00:10:11,319
You should know that by now.

170
00:10:11,402 --> 00:10:14,739
Give me one good reason
not to blow your brains out.

171
00:10:15,072 --> 00:10:16,032
[exhales sharply]

172
00:10:16,115 --> 00:10:18,743
[tense music playing]

173
00:10:19,493 --> 00:10:20,828
I'm done trying to convince you.

174
00:10:21,329 --> 00:10:23,331
If you want to shoot me, then do it.

175
00:10:24,040 --> 00:10:26,584
But I'm still going to try and find Lily.

176
00:10:29,170 --> 00:10:30,254
I'll do whatever it takes.

177
00:10:31,922 --> 00:10:33,132
Whatever it takes.

178
00:10:43,726 --> 00:10:47,188
[tense music continues]

179
00:11:03,579 --> 00:11:07,333
[action music playing]

180
00:11:17,718 --> 00:11:18,719
Ow.

181
00:11:23,224 --> 00:11:24,392
[groans]

182
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:27,561
[grunts]

183
00:11:31,273 --> 00:11:33,984
Now where is that she-devil?

184
00:11:34,944 --> 00:11:35,945
[groans]

185
00:11:38,614 --> 00:11:39,657
Helena.

186
00:11:41,283 --> 00:11:42,535
[groaning]

187
00:11:46,205 --> 00:11:50,751
You do not do this to Julio Ardiente.

188
00:11:53,212 --> 00:11:55,047
You are pissing me off.

189
00:11:55,131 --> 00:11:58,676
[tense music playing]

190
00:11:58,926 --> 00:11:59,927
[groans]

191
00:12:00,511 --> 00:12:01,512
Ow.

192
00:12:12,022 --> 00:12:13,607
Oh my.

193
00:12:15,985 --> 00:12:19,822
Poor stupid fool, Raul.

194
00:12:20,573 --> 00:12:23,409
My! I'm so sorry.

195
00:12:25,035 --> 00:12:30,082
Did you know that I did everything I could
to make you an Ardiente

196
00:12:30,166 --> 00:12:32,585
because that's what
I promised your father?

197
00:12:34,170 --> 00:12:36,464
But I'm sorry.

198
00:12:37,423 --> 00:12:40,134
Maybe your life
was meant to end like this.

199
00:12:41,844 --> 00:12:44,763
Rest in peace, Raul.

200
00:12:45,556 --> 00:12:46,515
[clicks tongue]

201
00:12:47,099 --> 00:12:48,601
You're so dumb.

202
00:12:49,101 --> 00:12:50,311
That's what you get.

203
00:12:51,937 --> 00:12:55,691
You should be proud of your daughter.

204
00:12:56,942 --> 00:13:00,946
Because Emilia herself shot Raul.

205
00:13:01,030 --> 00:13:02,990
[tense music playing]

206
00:13:04,366 --> 00:13:05,367
Wait a minute.

207
00:13:06,118 --> 00:13:08,704
Let me get this clear.

208
00:13:11,707 --> 00:13:13,667
Emilia shot Raul?

209
00:13:15,753 --> 00:13:17,296
[laughing]

210
00:13:20,090 --> 00:13:23,135
How poetic can things get?

211
00:13:24,637 --> 00:13:25,804
Can you imagine?

212
00:13:27,640 --> 00:13:33,646
The first man that Emilia
ever fell in love with

213
00:13:35,147 --> 00:13:38,150
is the very same man

214
00:13:38,234 --> 00:13:42,112
she's killed with her own bare hands.

215
00:13:42,905 --> 00:13:44,031
Poetic, isn't it?

216
00:13:44,823 --> 00:13:48,494
How many times did he make
a fool out of Emilia?

217
00:13:48,577 --> 00:13:49,870
That's why I'm wondering,

218
00:13:49,954 --> 00:13:52,248
why did it take her so long
to finally end him?

219
00:13:52,915 --> 00:13:57,211
Because she didn't know that
she'd actually shot her husband.

220
00:13:58,420 --> 00:14:02,091
-Huh?
-Yes. Baby girl did not know…

221
00:14:03,217 --> 00:14:05,469
that she shot Raul.

222
00:14:06,095 --> 00:14:07,930
Because when she shot him,

223
00:14:08,013 --> 00:14:10,266
he was wearing the Jaguar's mask.

224
00:14:11,392 --> 00:14:14,311
[Helena chuckles] Yes, Julio.

225
00:14:15,020 --> 00:14:18,649
Your "good-for-nothing" son-in-law…

226
00:14:20,025 --> 00:14:24,780
is the fake Jaguar
that gave you so much trouble.

227
00:14:24,864 --> 00:14:25,865
Ha!

228
00:14:26,907 --> 00:14:29,201
Are you surprised, huh?

229
00:14:31,537 --> 00:14:38,460
That traitor was right
under your nose the whole time.

230
00:14:39,461 --> 00:14:40,462
Hmm.

231
00:14:41,130 --> 00:14:47,553
What would the people of Ardiente say

232
00:14:47,636 --> 00:14:52,892
about their governor,
the great Julio Ardiente…

233
00:14:53,893 --> 00:14:57,813
being outwitted by his good-for-nothing,

234
00:14:57,897 --> 00:15:00,149
womanizing son-in-law?

235
00:15:00,900 --> 00:15:02,902
Huh? [laughing]

236
00:15:05,029 --> 00:15:08,240
[laughing]

237
00:15:08,324 --> 00:15:11,327
My! Oh, my, Helena!

238
00:15:11,785 --> 00:15:15,247
-You are gravely mistaken.
-Oh.

239
00:15:17,041 --> 00:15:19,335
Raul was never a threat to me!

240
00:15:19,793 --> 00:15:22,254
That's why I never wasted time on him!

241
00:15:23,130 --> 00:15:24,924
I could have killed him just like that.

242
00:15:25,591 --> 00:15:27,176
-Just like you.
-Aww.

243
00:15:27,259 --> 00:15:30,220
I could take you out anytime I want.

244
00:15:30,763 --> 00:15:33,766
You have exhausted my patience!

245
00:15:33,849 --> 00:15:36,393
I'm--I'm tired of… I don't--

246
00:15:36,477 --> 00:15:38,062
I don't wanna play games with you anymore.

247
00:15:38,145 --> 00:15:40,314
-It's not fun anymore!
-Aww.

248
00:15:40,397 --> 00:15:42,983
Let's put an end to this, huh?

249
00:15:44,318 --> 00:15:45,319
Huh?

250
00:15:45,736 --> 00:15:48,280
-What a big gun you have.
-[Helena chuckling]

251
00:15:48,781 --> 00:15:52,534
Now, why don't you point it
right at my chest…

252
00:15:54,119 --> 00:15:55,245
and shoot.

253
00:15:56,705 --> 00:16:00,584
Now, call my bluff if you think it is.

254
00:16:00,668 --> 00:16:04,338
Come on. How about you and me, my dear?

255
00:16:04,421 --> 00:16:08,175
How about we have this date in hell?

256
00:16:08,258 --> 00:16:09,009
Huh?!

257
00:16:09,093 --> 00:16:11,011
Come on. Shoot me. Shoot me.

258
00:16:11,095 --> 00:16:12,680
-Shoot me!
-[Helena laughing]

259
00:16:13,097 --> 00:16:17,267
Not tonight, Julio, my dear.

260
00:16:18,394 --> 00:16:19,353
Girls.

261
00:16:21,105 --> 00:16:21,939
Wha-- What's--

262
00:16:22,022 --> 00:16:25,150
[Helena laughing]

263
00:16:26,110 --> 00:16:28,028
[tense music playing]

264
00:16:28,112 --> 00:16:29,154
[grunting]

265
00:16:31,490 --> 00:16:33,242
Take Julio with you.

266
00:16:34,118 --> 00:16:35,828
And please handle him with care.

267
00:16:35,911 --> 00:16:40,749
Because you know
how brittle his bones are.

268
00:16:40,833 --> 00:16:42,584
-This is unfair!
-[Helena laughs]

269
00:16:42,668 --> 00:16:47,047
And, make sure that none of you
disturb me in here!

270
00:16:47,923 --> 00:16:48,966
Bye, Julio.

271
00:16:49,258 --> 00:16:51,802
-I'll kill you for--Ow!
-Sure.

272
00:16:52,511 --> 00:16:56,890
Easy, girls. I can't walk.
Like… Get off me! You…

273
00:16:57,141 --> 00:16:58,100
You're worst than--

274
00:16:58,183 --> 00:16:59,852
-Helpless…
-Women! You're worst than men!

275
00:16:59,935 --> 00:17:02,021
Ow! [grunts] You stop pushing me!

276
00:17:02,104 --> 00:17:03,939
-old man.
-Ow! Ow!

277
00:17:04,023 --> 00:17:06,025
Jibber-jabber. Ugh!

278
00:17:08,610 --> 00:17:12,656
[tense music playing]

279
00:17:17,161 --> 00:17:18,120
[coughs]

280
00:17:18,620 --> 00:17:22,624
[somber music playing]

281
00:17:25,252 --> 00:17:28,255
<i>Diego. Diego. Arnaldo.</i>

282
00:17:36,722 --> 00:17:37,723
Dad?

283
00:17:45,647 --> 00:17:46,648
Dad.

284
00:17:49,068 --> 00:17:50,194
You're bleeding.

285
00:17:50,277 --> 00:17:51,320
-Diego.
-Can you stand?

286
00:17:53,072 --> 00:17:55,699
Dad. Dad, hang in there.
I'll ask for help.

287
00:17:56,158 --> 00:17:57,701
Just stay here. I'll ask for help. Dad.

288
00:17:57,785 --> 00:17:58,786
[shushes]

289
00:17:58,869 --> 00:18:02,873
[somber music playing]

290
00:18:04,583 --> 00:18:05,584
Dad.

291
00:18:07,211 --> 00:18:08,337
Son.

292
00:18:08,754 --> 00:18:10,464
-Dad, I'll ask for help.
-Son. [shushes]

293
00:18:10,839 --> 00:18:11,632
Listen to me.

294
00:18:17,638 --> 00:18:19,723
Forgive me for all my…

295
00:18:21,475 --> 00:18:24,019
all my shortcomings.

296
00:18:25,646 --> 00:18:26,980
Please forgive me.

297
00:18:27,648 --> 00:18:29,274
Please forgive me.

298
00:18:32,444 --> 00:18:34,571
Please forgive me for failing to give you…

299
00:18:35,489 --> 00:18:37,241
a good life, son.

300
00:18:37,491 --> 00:18:40,119
Dad. Dad. Dad, don't talk like that.

301
00:18:41,912 --> 00:18:43,288
All I want now…

302
00:18:44,873 --> 00:18:46,625
is for you to help your brother.

303
00:18:47,501 --> 00:18:48,919
Please help Arnaldo.

304
00:18:49,545 --> 00:18:53,006
Your brother needs you.
Your brother needs you!

305
00:18:55,926 --> 00:18:56,927
And…

306
00:18:58,053 --> 00:19:01,014
I just want you and Lily to be happy.

307
00:19:01,640 --> 00:19:04,560
-Dad, you won't die.
-Son, listen to me.

308
00:19:04,643 --> 00:19:06,228
-Dad, you won't die.
-Listen to me.

309
00:19:06,311 --> 00:19:08,021
-I'll save you.
-Listen to me.

310
00:19:08,105 --> 00:19:09,231
-Listen to me.
-No…

311
00:19:09,648 --> 00:19:12,526
When I die, you need to be strong.

312
00:19:12,985 --> 00:19:13,861
No. No.

313
00:19:13,944 --> 00:19:17,906
-Be strong. Okay?
-No… No… We won't give up.

314
00:19:17,990 --> 00:19:20,284
Listen to what I'm telling you.

315
00:19:20,617 --> 00:19:22,411
Help your brother.

316
00:19:22,494 --> 00:19:24,913
-Dad, Dad. Dad.
-I love you so much. I love…

317
00:19:25,205 --> 00:19:27,457
-Dad.
-I love you so much.

318
00:19:27,541 --> 00:19:28,709
I love you…

319
00:19:29,251 --> 00:19:31,962
Dad. Dad. Dad. I'll save--

320
00:19:33,422 --> 00:19:34,506
Dad!

321
00:19:34,590 --> 00:19:35,382
Dad!

322
00:19:36,049 --> 00:19:38,093
Dad. Dad, keep fighting!

323
00:19:39,094 --> 00:19:40,179
Dad!

324
00:19:40,262 --> 00:19:41,263
Dad!

325
00:19:41,763 --> 00:19:42,764
Dad!

326
00:19:48,187 --> 00:19:51,231
[ominous piano music playing]

327
00:19:56,820 --> 00:19:57,738
Dad.

328
00:19:57,821 --> 00:20:00,115
-Dad, keep fighting.
-[Raul's breathing stops]

329
00:20:00,199 --> 00:20:04,536
[ominous music continues]

330
00:20:04,620 --> 00:20:05,621
Dad.

331
00:20:35,400 --> 00:20:37,110
You bastards!

332
00:20:38,111 --> 00:20:39,821
All of you!

333
00:20:40,030 --> 00:20:42,449
You killed everyone I love!

334
00:20:43,283 --> 00:20:44,743
What more do you want?!

335
00:20:45,619 --> 00:20:46,828
What more?!

336
00:20:46,912 --> 00:20:50,916
[ominous music playing]

337
00:21:12,688 --> 00:21:16,692
[action music playing]

338
00:21:28,537 --> 00:21:30,580
-Have you found them?
-No, ma'am.

339
00:21:31,331 --> 00:21:33,333
[Emilia] Make sure you bar all the gates.

340
00:21:33,417 --> 00:21:35,168
They're not getting out of here alive.

341
00:21:35,252 --> 00:21:36,003
-Yes, ma'am.
-Check again!

342
00:21:36,086 --> 00:21:37,087
Where's the control room?

343
00:21:37,462 --> 00:21:39,047
Lino, go with her.

344
00:21:41,049 --> 00:21:44,469
[suspenseful music building]

345
00:21:55,981 --> 00:21:56,982
Camia…

346
00:21:59,568 --> 00:22:01,403
[Emilia] <i>Damian, come out!</i>

347
00:22:02,863 --> 00:22:04,031
Where are you?

348
00:22:05,240 --> 00:22:06,908
Don't make this hard for me.

349
00:22:06,992 --> 00:22:07,909
[keys clicking]

350
00:22:07,993 --> 00:22:08,869
Come out!

351
00:22:11,872 --> 00:22:12,873
Camia!

352
00:22:12,956 --> 00:22:13,915
<i>Damian!</i>

353
00:22:13,999 --> 00:22:16,126
<i>Stop giving me a hard time.</i>

354
00:22:17,669 --> 00:22:19,463
<i>Because there will only be one outcome.</i>

355
00:22:19,796 --> 00:22:22,841
I'll cover your bodies in bullet holes!

356
00:22:23,216 --> 00:22:27,304
[somber music playing]

357
00:22:33,894 --> 00:22:35,187
I killed Raul…

358
00:22:35,270 --> 00:22:36,605
<i>because of you.</i>

359
00:22:36,855 --> 00:22:37,814
[ominous music playing]

360
00:22:37,898 --> 00:22:39,441
<i>I killed my husband…</i>

361
00:22:39,524 --> 00:22:40,609
because of you.

362
00:22:42,402 --> 00:22:44,321
-[screaming]
-[gunshots]

363
00:22:44,404 --> 00:22:45,489
[screams]

364
00:22:45,572 --> 00:22:47,908
<i>I killed my husband because of you!</i>

365
00:22:53,497 --> 00:22:58,251
Because until the end, my
husband still chose you over me.

366
00:23:00,921 --> 00:23:02,923
He chose you, Camia.

367
00:23:05,008 --> 00:23:06,009
That's why…

368
00:23:07,219 --> 00:23:08,929
I'll kill you.

369
00:23:09,846 --> 00:23:12,933
I'll rip you two to shreds!

370
00:23:13,016 --> 00:23:16,812
[tense music playing]

371
00:23:22,984 --> 00:23:24,069
[line ringing]

372
00:23:25,487 --> 00:23:26,571
[line ringing]

373
00:23:27,030 --> 00:23:28,323
[whispering] Damn it.

374
00:23:35,330 --> 00:23:36,623
Arnaldo.

375
00:23:37,374 --> 00:23:38,416
Hello, Mom.

376
00:23:39,417 --> 00:23:41,503
What's wrong? Why weren't you picking up?

377
00:23:43,171 --> 00:23:44,381
I killed him.

378
00:23:46,216 --> 00:23:47,342
I killed him.

379
00:23:47,425 --> 00:23:50,220
[tense music playing]

380
00:23:50,303 --> 00:23:52,848
Who's dead? Who did you kill?

381
00:23:55,851 --> 00:23:57,435
I killed your father.

382
00:24:01,148 --> 00:24:02,691
I killed him.

383
00:24:03,692 --> 00:24:05,235
Where are you? I'll head there.

384
00:24:08,989 --> 00:24:11,783
I'm at Camia's warehouse.

385
00:24:12,701 --> 00:24:13,785
Looking for her.

386
00:24:14,494 --> 00:24:16,121
And I'm going to kill that woman.

387
00:24:17,122 --> 00:24:20,000
I'm going to kill them all!

388
00:24:20,375 --> 00:24:24,337
[tense music swelling]

389
00:24:43,690 --> 00:24:45,442
[laughing]

390
00:24:50,155 --> 00:24:53,658
There they are. [laughing]

391
00:24:56,286 --> 00:24:58,079
Found you two.

392
00:25:00,332 --> 00:25:01,625
-Hello.
-[goon] <i>Yes, ma'am?</i>

393
00:25:02,209 --> 00:25:03,668
They're at the mess hall.

394
00:25:05,003 --> 00:25:10,091
Bring Camia here to me
because I'm going to kill her myself.

395
00:25:10,884 --> 00:25:13,762
As for Damian, I'll leave him to you.

396
00:25:17,432 --> 00:25:20,518
[tense music playing]

397
00:25:25,649 --> 00:25:27,567
[rock music playing]

398
00:25:27,651 --> 00:25:28,860
You watch that area.

399
00:25:37,410 --> 00:25:39,496
[action music playing]

400
00:25:39,579 --> 00:25:40,622
[goon grunts]

401
00:25:40,705 --> 00:25:41,748
[grunts]

402
00:25:43,792 --> 00:25:46,503
[action music playing]

403
00:25:52,676 --> 00:25:55,971
[action music continues]

404
00:26:13,154 --> 00:26:14,489
<i>I'm coming, Mom.</i>

405
00:26:20,996 --> 00:26:25,000
[ominous music playing]

406
00:26:31,172 --> 00:26:32,966
-Show yourselves!
-[gunshots]

407
00:26:37,637 --> 00:26:38,430
[giggling]

408
00:26:38,513 --> 00:26:40,348
[laughing]

409
00:26:40,765 --> 00:26:41,766
[goon] <i>Come on!</i>

410
00:26:42,225 --> 00:26:43,476
Not coming out, huh?

411
00:26:43,560 --> 00:26:46,104
[gunshots]

412
00:26:47,355 --> 00:26:50,942
[laughing]

413
00:26:51,026 --> 00:26:52,444
[crying]

414
00:26:53,194 --> 00:26:54,237
[Damian] Don't shoot!

415
00:26:55,739 --> 00:26:57,907
Stop! Stop shooting!

416
00:27:00,201 --> 00:27:01,286
Camia.

417
00:27:01,995 --> 00:27:03,413
[crying]

418
00:27:11,254 --> 00:27:15,133
We wasted all these bullets for nothing.

419
00:27:15,759 --> 00:27:17,052
Take her to Ma'am Emilia!

420
00:27:17,135 --> 00:27:19,387
[tense music playing]

421
00:27:19,471 --> 00:27:20,555
Bang!

422
00:27:23,725 --> 00:27:25,143
-Come here.
-Let me go!

423
00:27:25,226 --> 00:27:26,936
-Come here.
-Let go of me!

424
00:27:27,020 --> 00:27:28,355
-Don't touch her!
-I said come here!

425
00:27:28,438 --> 00:27:29,522
-[thuds]
-[Damian grunts]

426
00:27:30,023 --> 00:27:32,025
-Damian!
-I said, come here!

427
00:27:32,317 --> 00:27:33,318
[Camia] Damian!

428
00:27:37,030 --> 00:27:38,448
-Come here.
-Damian!

429
00:27:38,698 --> 00:27:40,450
[goon] Come here! Stop resisting!

430
00:27:40,533 --> 00:27:44,537
[tense music continues]

431
00:27:48,917 --> 00:27:50,794
Camia!

432
00:27:57,300 --> 00:27:58,385
You bastard!

433
00:27:58,760 --> 00:28:01,638
[action music playing]

434
00:28:01,721 --> 00:28:02,931
[goon] Say your prayers!

435
00:28:10,021 --> 00:28:11,272
-[thuds]
-[screaming]

436
00:28:33,753 --> 00:28:34,754
[goon] Hey!

437
00:28:41,177 --> 00:28:45,014
[action music playing]

438
00:28:47,142 --> 00:28:50,478
[gunshots]

439
00:29:02,782 --> 00:29:03,616
Come here!

440
00:29:03,700 --> 00:29:05,785
[screaming]

441
00:29:13,877 --> 00:29:14,961
[gunshots]

442
00:29:38,151 --> 00:29:39,778
Mr. Damian, have you found them?

443
00:29:39,861 --> 00:29:42,739
I found Camia, but Emilia's men took her.

444
00:29:42,822 --> 00:29:44,240
I can't find Lily.

445
00:29:45,909 --> 00:29:46,910
Diego…

446
00:29:47,494 --> 00:29:48,328
your father…

447
00:29:49,662 --> 00:29:53,666
[somber music playing]

448
00:30:09,766 --> 00:30:10,809
[goon] Move it!

449
00:30:10,892 --> 00:30:12,227
-[Camia] Let me go!
-[goon] Ma'am!

450
00:30:14,896 --> 00:30:16,564
Leave the two of us alone.

451
00:30:17,649 --> 00:30:19,901
We'll settle this once and for all.

452
00:30:19,984 --> 00:30:21,736
None of you must interfere! Get out!

453
00:30:22,195 --> 00:30:23,154
[goon] Yes, ma'am!

454
00:30:23,238 --> 00:30:26,032
[tense music playing]

455
00:30:26,449 --> 00:30:28,326
Try to run now,

456
00:30:28,409 --> 00:30:31,204
and I'll make sure
you join my cheating husband.

457
00:30:32,413 --> 00:30:35,750
Aren't you tired of committing
all these crimes, Emilia?

458
00:30:37,669 --> 00:30:40,713
Actually, I'm tired of chasing
around this place.

459
00:30:41,130 --> 00:30:43,842
But, you know,
just to answer your question…

460
00:30:44,217 --> 00:30:45,218
Yes.

461
00:30:45,802 --> 00:30:48,221
I am sick and tired of this.

462
00:30:49,347 --> 00:30:51,224
I'm sick and tired of you!

463
00:30:52,308 --> 00:30:55,186
Ever since you moved
into Poblacion Ardiente,

464
00:30:55,270 --> 00:30:56,938
you ruined my life!

465
00:30:57,480 --> 00:30:59,107
You ruined my family!

466
00:31:00,567 --> 00:31:04,904
I even killed my own husband
because of you.

467
00:31:07,323 --> 00:31:10,034
Your family tore mine apart, Emilia.

468
00:31:11,744 --> 00:31:13,663
We were living in peace.

469
00:31:14,831 --> 00:31:18,376
We didn't do anything to you,
but what did you do?

470
00:31:18,459 --> 00:31:20,712
You had my husband killed,

471
00:31:20,795 --> 00:31:22,672
you attempted to kill my daughter,

472
00:31:22,755 --> 00:31:24,716
and you had me raped!

473
00:31:27,010 --> 00:31:29,387
You're sick! I was violated!

474
00:31:30,513 --> 00:31:33,224
So, go ahead! Kill me now!

475
00:31:33,308 --> 00:31:37,270
But, I promise you, I'll drag
you with me to my grave!

476
00:31:40,106 --> 00:31:41,816
You're going to pay for this, Emilia.

477
00:31:42,442 --> 00:31:45,361
You'll pay for everything
you've done to us!

478
00:31:46,029 --> 00:31:47,572
Let's end this now!

479
00:31:51,117 --> 00:31:55,121
[tense music playing]

480
00:32:26,903 --> 00:32:27,904
Mom.

481
00:32:34,118 --> 00:32:35,203
Diego.

482
00:32:41,709 --> 00:32:43,711
What a surprise to see you, Lily Cruz!

483
00:32:43,920 --> 00:32:45,004
[gunshot]

484
00:32:45,588 --> 00:32:46,631
[gunshots]

485
00:32:46,714 --> 00:32:48,591
[tense music playing]

486
00:32:48,675 --> 00:32:51,594
[gunshots]

487
00:32:54,555 --> 00:32:55,682
[squealing]

488
00:32:55,974 --> 00:32:56,975
[squealing]

489
00:32:57,809 --> 00:33:00,687
[action music playing]

490
00:33:36,264 --> 00:33:37,849
[tense music playing]

491
00:33:37,932 --> 00:33:38,891
[gunshot]

492
00:33:39,934 --> 00:33:40,768
[scoffs]

493
00:33:42,145 --> 00:33:43,229
Finally.

494
00:33:43,730 --> 00:33:46,190
I get to kill you myself!

495
00:33:46,482 --> 00:33:49,485
-Where is my mother?
-Obviously, she isn't here.

496
00:33:50,069 --> 00:33:51,070
She's there!

497
00:33:51,821 --> 00:33:53,156
With Emilia.

498
00:33:55,324 --> 00:33:56,951
You're all despicable.

499
00:33:57,035 --> 00:33:59,328
Yes, we really are!

500
00:33:59,787 --> 00:34:03,207
And Emilia wouldn't think twice
about killing your mother!

501
00:34:03,583 --> 00:34:06,586
If she was able to kill her own husband,

502
00:34:07,837 --> 00:34:10,131
how much more so your mother…

503
00:34:12,175 --> 00:34:14,677
who happens to be the bane
of her existence?!

504
00:34:17,221 --> 00:34:18,222
[gunshot]

505
00:34:18,723 --> 00:34:19,682
[glass shattering]

506
00:34:21,392 --> 00:34:22,393
[Helena screams]

507
00:34:26,773 --> 00:34:27,774
[yelps]

508
00:34:32,695 --> 00:34:33,696
Go on!

509
00:34:35,323 --> 00:34:36,324
Well?!

510
00:34:36,407 --> 00:34:39,077
Can you still fight, Mama Hel?

511
00:34:39,160 --> 00:34:42,538
[tense music playing]

512
00:34:47,335 --> 00:34:49,462
[action music playing]

513
00:35:09,524 --> 00:35:10,525
[groans]

514
00:35:29,001 --> 00:35:30,419
I can't wait to shoot!

515
00:35:30,753 --> 00:35:33,923
I can't wait to kill all you Ardientes!

516
00:35:35,800 --> 00:35:39,804
And your stupid daughter
may have my mother.

517
00:35:39,887 --> 00:35:43,015
But I have her twisted mother!

518
00:35:43,558 --> 00:35:46,060
So, if your daughter
does something to my mother,

519
00:35:47,353 --> 00:35:48,604
you, Helena,

520
00:35:49,188 --> 00:35:51,858
will be the first one
I'll send to the grave!

521
00:35:51,941 --> 00:35:55,444
[tense music playing]

522
00:35:55,820 --> 00:35:57,822
I won't hold back any longer!

523
00:35:58,781 --> 00:36:00,783
Right now, I'm ready to kill you.

524
00:36:11,752 --> 00:36:13,796
[action music playing]

525
00:36:21,512 --> 00:36:22,346
Go on!

526
00:36:25,892 --> 00:36:27,476
Before this night is over,

527
00:36:27,560 --> 00:36:29,604
I'll have my revenge on you
and your daughter!

528
00:36:30,146 --> 00:36:32,565
I'll kill you both and bury you together!

529
00:36:33,316 --> 00:36:34,984
Don't be so sure, Emilia.

530
00:36:35,568 --> 00:36:38,404
No matter how many times
you try to bury us,

531
00:36:38,863 --> 00:36:40,531
we'll always come back to haunt you!

532
00:36:40,615 --> 00:36:41,657
Yes, you're right.

533
00:36:41,741 --> 00:36:42,950
But, this time,

534
00:36:43,409 --> 00:36:46,579
I'll fill both of your bodies with bullets

535
00:36:46,662 --> 00:36:48,039
before I bury you together!

536
00:36:48,122 --> 00:36:50,499
[tense music playing]

537
00:36:52,418 --> 00:36:54,045
Oh, by the way…

538
00:36:54,420 --> 00:36:57,381
I've been wanting
to do this for a long time now.

539
00:37:01,344 --> 00:37:02,386
[Camia grunting]

540
00:37:08,684 --> 00:37:09,769
Don't you dare!

541
00:37:09,852 --> 00:37:11,979
[action music playing]

542
00:37:13,606 --> 00:37:14,607
Huh?

543
00:37:15,942 --> 00:37:20,321
You know, I should've killed you ages ago!

544
00:37:22,198 --> 00:37:23,157
So…

545
00:37:24,909 --> 00:37:26,494
did I stress you out?

546
00:37:26,577 --> 00:37:30,164
Hmm? [laughing]

547
00:37:34,502 --> 00:37:36,754
Say goodbye, Camia.

548
00:37:37,964 --> 00:37:39,465
Say goodbye, Camia!

549
00:37:41,759 --> 00:37:46,597
Say goodbye to the cruel world, Camia!

550
00:37:47,139 --> 00:37:48,391
-Come here!
-[Helena groans]

551
00:37:49,725 --> 00:37:50,726
Emilia!

552
00:37:54,814 --> 00:37:55,940
Lily!

553
00:37:57,441 --> 00:37:59,151
[tense music playing]

554
00:37:59,235 --> 00:38:00,236
[Helena groaning]

555
00:38:01,570 --> 00:38:02,989
Let go of my mother!

556
00:38:04,782 --> 00:38:06,826
If you kill my mother,

557
00:38:06,909 --> 00:38:08,577
I'll kill yours!

558
00:38:09,870 --> 00:38:14,959
And I'll make sure you'll be gone
even before the sun rises!

559
00:38:16,377 --> 00:38:17,586
Let go of her!

560
00:38:17,670 --> 00:38:18,796
<i>No!</i>

561
00:38:18,879 --> 00:38:20,506
[tense music continues]

562
00:38:20,589 --> 00:38:23,759
Let go of my mother first.

563
00:38:24,844 --> 00:38:26,304
Let go of my mama!

564
00:38:27,054 --> 00:38:28,723
You still won't give in, huh?

565
00:38:29,598 --> 00:38:30,808
You won't?!

566
00:38:30,891 --> 00:38:31,726
[groaning]

567
00:38:31,809 --> 00:38:35,354
[action music playing]

568
00:38:35,896 --> 00:38:38,357
I said let go of Mama!

569
00:38:40,651 --> 00:38:41,652
Tell you what.

570
00:38:43,529 --> 00:38:46,866
I'm sure you don't want your mama to die.

571
00:38:46,949 --> 00:38:48,826
<i>Right, baby girl?</i>

572
00:38:49,368 --> 00:38:51,037
<i>I'll let go of your mother.</i>

573
00:38:51,120 --> 00:38:52,621
<i>Let's meet.</i>

574
00:38:52,705 --> 00:38:56,876
Your mother in exchange for my mother!

575
00:38:58,836 --> 00:38:59,754
<i>Well?</i>

576
00:39:02,006 --> 00:39:02,923
Well?!

577
00:39:03,549 --> 00:39:08,095
[action music continues]

578
00:39:08,846 --> 00:39:10,181
Lily's safe.

579
00:39:10,264 --> 00:39:11,682
Diego, we need to help Camia.

580
00:39:12,391 --> 00:39:13,392
Let's go.

581
00:39:13,893 --> 00:39:16,645
[suspenseful music playing]

582
00:39:16,896 --> 00:39:17,897
Fine.

583
00:39:19,106 --> 00:39:20,316
Where will we meet?

584
00:39:20,733 --> 00:39:22,860
Don't you dare try anything, Emilia.

585
00:39:23,110 --> 00:39:25,654
It should just be you and my mother.

586
00:39:26,405 --> 00:39:28,866
If I see any of your men…

587
00:39:29,241 --> 00:39:32,161
even just the shadow of your men…

588
00:39:34,830 --> 00:39:39,710
I'll blow your
precious mother's brains out.

589
00:39:56,268 --> 00:39:58,646
[cries]

590
00:40:03,442 --> 00:40:05,152
[laughing]

591
00:40:06,779 --> 00:40:08,948
You were the man behind the mask.

592
00:40:09,323 --> 00:40:11,283
It fits you, Dad, it fits you.

593
00:40:11,367 --> 00:40:13,035
[tense music playing]

594
00:40:13,119 --> 00:40:14,120
This…

595
00:40:15,121 --> 00:40:18,916
This somehow summarizes
your pitiful life, you know?

596
00:40:20,709 --> 00:40:21,710
Imagine,

597
00:40:22,711 --> 00:40:27,758
you hid behind a mask
just to be a somebody.

598
00:40:28,175 --> 00:40:32,471
Just like how you hid
behind the Ardiente family name

599
00:40:32,555 --> 00:40:34,014
for the longest time.

600
00:40:34,682 --> 00:40:37,726
Because let's face it, without Ardiente,

601
00:40:37,810 --> 00:40:41,147
there is no Raul Torillo, right?

602
00:40:42,940 --> 00:40:44,066
You're worthless.

603
00:40:44,733 --> 00:40:46,235
And useless.

604
00:40:46,819 --> 00:40:50,156
You are nothing.

605
00:40:51,073 --> 00:40:53,367
Oh, no, no, no, you're not nothing.

606
00:40:53,451 --> 00:40:57,496
Your worth is less than nothing.

607
00:40:58,497 --> 00:40:59,999
Why? Why?

608
00:41:01,083 --> 00:41:04,128
Because you were never good at anything.

609
00:41:05,004 --> 00:41:09,133
You were never a good husband to Mom.

610
00:41:09,675 --> 00:41:13,262
All those years of pain
you inflicted on her.

611
00:41:14,430 --> 00:41:16,098
You deserve much worse.

612
00:41:17,933 --> 00:41:19,810
If only I could wake you up,

613
00:41:20,352 --> 00:41:21,687
revive you,

614
00:41:21,770 --> 00:41:23,397
I would kill you again.

615
00:41:26,400 --> 00:41:28,027
That's how much I hate you.

616
00:41:29,612 --> 00:41:30,738
What? I'm sorry?

617
00:41:30,821 --> 00:41:31,864
What did you say?

618
00:41:31,947 --> 00:41:34,700
Oh, no, no, is this the part
where you say you're sorry?

619
00:41:35,784 --> 00:41:37,411
Well, guess what? Screw you!

620
00:41:40,414 --> 00:41:43,918
Don't expect me to mourn
for you now that you're gone.

621
00:41:46,795 --> 00:41:48,172
Because after all…

622
00:41:51,467 --> 00:41:52,468
you…

623
00:41:56,805 --> 00:41:58,891
you were never a father to me.

624
00:41:58,974 --> 00:42:02,937
[tense music continues]

625
00:42:32,675 --> 00:42:33,676
Goal!

626
00:42:35,344 --> 00:42:36,345
Bye!

627
00:42:40,933 --> 00:42:44,895
[tense music playing]

628
00:42:56,031 --> 00:42:57,199
They're gone.

629
00:42:57,950 --> 00:42:59,368
We have to find them.

630
00:42:59,910 --> 00:43:00,911
Let's go.

631
00:43:02,288 --> 00:43:03,747
-[thuds]
-[Helena groans]

632
00:43:05,624 --> 00:43:08,168
Stop whining. Keep walking!
Hurry! Move it!

633
00:43:15,884 --> 00:43:16,885
[groans]

634
00:43:20,097 --> 00:43:23,851
Keep walking, and don't even
think of escaping!

635
00:43:23,934 --> 00:43:24,810
[Emilia] Faster.

636
00:43:24,893 --> 00:43:26,103
-Hurry up.
-Let go of me!

637
00:43:26,186 --> 00:43:27,062
[goon] You're too slow!

638
00:43:27,146 --> 00:43:29,315
Stop pushing me! Stop pushing me!

639
00:43:29,398 --> 00:43:30,608
[chuckling]

640
00:43:30,691 --> 00:43:32,818
Wow, you've got spunk.

641
00:43:33,485 --> 00:43:36,989
But, you know too bad, that
won't save you from anything.

642
00:43:37,489 --> 00:43:38,991
Actually, nothing will save you.

643
00:43:39,074 --> 00:43:42,661
[chuckles] Whether you
like it or not, you will die.

644
00:43:44,330 --> 00:43:47,750
Be thankful that my mama
begged me to save her.

645
00:43:47,833 --> 00:43:49,918
Otherwise, you'd be dead by now.

646
00:43:50,753 --> 00:43:52,421
Mom can be such a burden.

647
00:43:52,504 --> 00:43:55,591
She can't even escape
from your daughter, Lily Cruz!

648
00:43:55,674 --> 00:43:57,259
What kind of a daughter are you?

649
00:43:58,052 --> 00:44:00,679
You'd put your own mother's life
in danger?

650
00:44:00,763 --> 00:44:03,766
[chuckles] You know, Camia,

651
00:44:03,849 --> 00:44:07,061
you and your daughter started all this.

652
00:44:07,144 --> 00:44:08,479
Well then let me go.

653
00:44:10,189 --> 00:44:11,106
What did you say?

654
00:44:11,565 --> 00:44:13,525
I'm sorry, but I'm not going to do that.

655
00:44:13,609 --> 00:44:14,943
Are you crazy?

656
00:44:15,027 --> 00:44:16,820
You and your daughter started this.

657
00:44:17,613 --> 00:44:20,032
I'll take revenge for my husband.

658
00:44:20,115 --> 00:44:21,367
A life for a life!

659
00:44:22,242 --> 00:44:24,161
You know, which reminds me…

660
00:44:24,244 --> 00:44:26,580
[tense music playing]

661
00:44:29,124 --> 00:44:30,542
I'm low on ammo.

662
00:44:30,626 --> 00:44:32,836
So, call for backup,

663
00:44:32,920 --> 00:44:35,297
get all our explosives,

664
00:44:35,381 --> 00:44:38,258
get every dangerous weapon,
and bring them to the quarry, okay?

665
00:44:38,676 --> 00:44:40,427
And call your friends too.

666
00:44:40,511 --> 00:44:44,765
Because I want this night to be
an explosive night to remember.

667
00:44:44,848 --> 00:44:46,225
[laughs]

668
00:44:46,308 --> 00:44:49,603
You bitch! You're going to
ambush my daughter? Monster!

669
00:44:49,687 --> 00:44:52,022
[laughing]

670
00:44:52,106 --> 00:44:54,108
-Let me go!
-What is wrong with you?!

671
00:44:54,566 --> 00:44:55,984
That is what we are known for.

672
00:44:56,068 --> 00:44:58,112
The Ardientes. That is our trademark.

673
00:44:58,487 --> 00:45:03,909
And the fireworks will begin as
soon as I see Lily Cruz arrive.

674
00:45:04,410 --> 00:45:08,956
I just wish and pray that, um,
my mama is bulletproof.

675
00:45:09,998 --> 00:45:10,999
You're a monster!

676
00:45:11,083 --> 00:45:12,459
You're insane!

677
00:45:12,543 --> 00:45:14,086
You're rotten to the core!

678
00:45:14,169 --> 00:45:15,629
You and your family!

679
00:45:16,088 --> 00:45:17,339
Let go of me!

680
00:45:17,423 --> 00:45:19,425
[tense music playing]

681
00:45:19,508 --> 00:45:20,676
-[Camia groans]
-[goon] Stay still!

682
00:45:21,260 --> 00:45:22,469
-Hey!
-Hold her.

683
00:45:22,553 --> 00:45:23,804
-Hey!
-Zip her mouth.

684
00:45:23,887 --> 00:45:24,805
-Monster!
-Oh my…

685
00:45:24,888 --> 00:45:25,931
-You're a monster, Emilia!
-Stop!

686
00:45:26,014 --> 00:45:27,015
Damn you!

687
00:45:29,309 --> 00:45:31,019
[Emilia] Zip it. [shushes]

688
00:45:32,312 --> 00:45:34,815
Now you're quiet. I'm at peace.

689
00:45:35,315 --> 00:45:36,859
[Emilia] Whoo! [laughs]

690
00:45:40,279 --> 00:45:41,029
What now?

691
00:45:45,409 --> 00:45:48,996
[tense music playing]

692
00:45:59,339 --> 00:46:00,340
[phone chimes]

693
00:46:04,052 --> 00:46:05,888
YOUR GRANDFATHER IS ABOUT TO
BE BURIED ALIVE.

694
00:46:05,971 --> 00:46:07,806
GO TO SITIO 6 WHILE YOU STILL CAN.

695
00:46:07,890 --> 00:46:09,725
HURRY. HE DOESN'T HAVE
MUCH TIME LEFT.

696
00:46:16,899 --> 00:46:18,233
[engine starting]

697
00:46:19,860 --> 00:46:22,613
[engine revving]

698
00:46:24,615 --> 00:46:26,450
You! What are you doing?

699
00:46:27,159 --> 00:46:28,285
Help us.

700
00:46:28,368 --> 00:46:29,536
I just needed to send a text.

701
00:46:29,620 --> 00:46:31,622
[tense music continues]

702
00:46:43,050 --> 00:46:44,051
[Lily] Move.

703
00:46:47,596 --> 00:46:48,597
Stay there.

704
00:46:51,391 --> 00:46:55,354
[dramatic music playing]

705
00:47:03,862 --> 00:47:04,947
Be quiet.

706
00:47:12,079 --> 00:47:16,083
[somber music playing]

707
00:47:20,546 --> 00:47:21,505
Diego?

708
00:47:28,053 --> 00:47:28,887
Uncle Damian.

709
00:47:28,971 --> 00:47:30,889
[somber music continues]

710
00:47:36,812 --> 00:47:37,771
Diego.

711
00:47:37,854 --> 00:47:41,733
[somber music playing]

712
00:48:04,089 --> 00:48:05,257
[Lily crying]

713
00:48:10,095 --> 00:48:11,346
You're alive.

714
00:48:15,684 --> 00:48:17,561
[sighs] Thank goodness you're alive.

715
00:48:17,644 --> 00:48:18,895
You're safe.

716
00:48:21,523 --> 00:48:23,775
[somber music continues]

717
00:48:26,570 --> 00:48:27,779
[tense music playing]

718
00:48:27,863 --> 00:48:28,864
You monster.

719
00:48:28,947 --> 00:48:31,325
Diego. Diego, don't. Stop.

720
00:48:35,412 --> 00:48:37,205
Emilia has my mother.

721
00:48:39,833 --> 00:48:41,918
And as much as I want to kill this woman,

722
00:48:42,002 --> 00:48:43,128
we can't do that yet.

723
00:48:46,673 --> 00:48:49,259
Emilia and I will trade hostages.

724
00:48:49,343 --> 00:48:51,136
But after that,

725
00:48:52,137 --> 00:48:55,057
I'll kill Red Dragon myself.

726
00:48:56,933 --> 00:49:00,812
[tense music playing]

727
00:49:09,112 --> 00:49:11,740
[Arnaldo] <i>Thank you</i>
<i>for your loyal service.</i>

728
00:49:11,823 --> 00:49:12,658
[gunshot]

729
00:49:12,741 --> 00:49:15,869
[Julio] <i>Now, where is that witch,</i>
<i>Helena Montoya?!</i>

730
00:49:15,952 --> 00:49:17,913
<i>I am going to kill her.</i>

731
00:49:17,996 --> 00:49:19,539
<i>And if she survives, I'll kill her again.</i>

732
00:49:19,623 --> 00:49:23,168
<i>-Let my mother go!</i>
<i>-You let my mother go!</i>

733
00:49:23,251 --> 00:49:24,252
[Emilia] <i>At the same time!</i>

734
00:49:29,633 --> 00:49:30,676
[Camia] <i>Lily, it's an ambush!</i>

735
00:49:30,759 --> 00:49:32,302
<i>Shoot them, baby girl! Shoot them!</i>

736
00:49:32,386 --> 00:49:33,428
-[gunshot]
-<i>Mama!</i>

737
00:49:33,512 --> 00:49:36,556
-[yelps]
-[gunshots and screams]

738
00:49:36,640 --> 00:49:37,599
[gunfire]

739
00:49:40,435 --> 00:49:42,145
[explosion]

740
00:49:42,229 --> 00:49:44,439
[theme music playing]
